    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Melee Weapons</p><p>You have practiced techniques useful in melee combat against spellcasters.</p><ul><li><p>Once per turn, when a creature within melee range of you casts a spell or uses a <strong>Path Ability</strong>, you can make a free <strong>Melee</strong> attack against that creature.</p></li><li><p>You have <strong>Advantage</strong> on <strong>Resistance Checks</strong> against spells and path abilities used by creatures adjacent to you.</p></li></ul>",
